{
  "description": "This is a plate filling protocol for a reverse transcriptase procedure. Up to 95 samples can be prepped using 4-in-1 tube racks filled with barcode primer mixes and a prepared enzyme mix in the final tube.\nExplanation of complex parameters below:\n Number of Samples: Specify the number of samples this run (1-95)\n Reagent Volume to Add: Specify the volume of RT mix to add. Default is 4.7 uL\n Well Plate Type: Change between the BioRad plate in the OT-2 default labware library and the custom definition for Greiner 96 well plates with a circular well\n P20 Mount: Specify which side the single-channel P20 is mounted to",
  "tags": [
    "PCR Prep",
    "Reverse Transcriptase"
  ],
